Wayland is the display server protocol library: libwayland-client, libwayland-server,
libwayland-cursor, libwayland-egl and the wayland-scanner code generator. Built
without docs, tests or DTD validation. Installs libraries, headers, .pc files and
wayland-scanner under /usr/local.
upstream: https://wayland.freedesktop.org/
